graph TD
    Web["Web UI / LLM Client"]
    McpLambda["MCP Server Lambda <br> (McpFunction - Python)"]
    S3Image["S3: Robot Image Bucket <br> (RobotImageBucket)"]
    DynamoSpeech["DynamoDB: Speech Table <br> (SpeechTable)"]
    DynamoRobot["DynamoDB: Robot Table <br> (RobotTable)"]
    Polly["Amazon Polly Speech Synthesis"]
    IoTCore["AWS IoT Core (MQTT)"]

    Web -->|Function URL - IAM Authorized| McpLambda
    McpLambda -->|1. Store/Retrieve Captured Images| S3Image
    McpLambda -->|2. Cache synthesized speech| DynamoSpeech
    McpLambda -->|3. Read telemetry state| DynamoRobot
    McpLambda -->|4. Request Speech Synthesis| Polly
    McpLambda -->|5. Publish MQTT control schema| IoTCore

    class McpLambda Compute;
    class S3Image,DynamoSpeech,DynamoRobot Storage;
    class Polly,IoTCore Gateway;
    class Web Client;

    classDef Compute fill:#FF9900,stroke:#D68100,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFFFFF;
    classDef Storage fill:#1A5F7A,stroke:#103F54,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFFFFF;
    classDef Gateway fill:#008B8B,stroke:#006666,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFFFFF;
    classDef Client fill:#4A4E69,stroke:#22223B,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFFFFF;
